279, 153.4921, 153.3812, 152.9725, 151.9174, 151.5219, 151.4062, 151.6988, 151.5547, 150.072, 150.2381, 151.2242, 151.5044, 152.0714, 151.1305, 148.4077, 148.9781, 145.8161, 143.9087, 144.35, 144.6537, 145.2183, 144.0208, 144.6466, 145.3468, 145.468, 146.8791, 148.0102, 146.7915, 147.5737, 146.4272, 147.8051, 148.7136, 150.6832, 151.0273, 150.6205, 150.5906, 149.806, 149.0649, 149.4911, 148.2774, 146.6234, 147.484, 146.646, 146.9742, 145.7977, 145.6302, 145.8477, 147.1735, 147.1564, 145.9139, 146.6583, 145.4099, 144.6358, 143.5633, 144.4156, 144.0427, 144.7847, 144.502, 143.6666, 143.5096, 143.7973, 143.3241, 144.3109, 142.8282, 142.2268, 142.1983, 141.3717, 144.0727, 144.1915, 143.4967, 143.8609, 144.2935, 144.4758, 145.4971, 145.7456, 144.9104, 143.2156, 145.578, 146.2458, 146.1454, 145.0119, 144.6619, 144.228, 144.867, 146.1573, 146.3764, 146.049, 145.9156, 145.7017, 143.3642, 145.341, 144.7599, 144.4138, 144.0052, 145.0746, 144.7146, 144.3001, 143.3684, 144.9185, 144.7596, 144.8429, 145.1478, 146.8296, 147.4443, 148.588, 148.5584, 150.2718, 149.4784, 148.3788, 146.7213, 147.2413, 146.7305, 147.8018, 148.0087, 151.1634, 151.0688, 151.3853, 151.6817, 152.3054, 150.1491, 149.143, 148.3041, 147.4891, 145.1598, 145.51, 146.3405, 146.4959, 145.9211, 145.9301, 146.288, 147.0269, 146.5485, 146.0265, 146.6514, 149.1112, 148.3768, 149.8925, 150.3817, 150.8343, 150.5199, 149.042, 148.2845, 148.4088, 149.3248, 149.4852, 149.8592, 150.1792, 150.582, 151.4353, 152.6007, 152.9987, 153.166, 152.0152, 150.9442, 152.2141, 154.0647, 155.5709, 155.2442, 154.6446, 155.4849, 155.9843, 156.6289, 157.1536, 157.4438, 155.5095, 153.7187, 155.205, 155.0923, 156.8046, 157.9432, 158.398, 158.6443, 159.0674, 159.0574, 159.4489, 159.9023, 158.9891, 157.7187, 158.3511, 157.0407, 155.8369, 155.7291, 155.8093, 154.7774, 153.8541, 154.2437, 154.1224, 153.6928, 152.7308, 153.5855, 153.7722, 152.7023, 153.4968, 153.4189, 153.4078, 153.8461, 155.1708, 154.2347, 153.9238, 155.6859, 158.3917, 159.6391, 160.1335, 160.6004, 163.1013, 163.2287, 164.4684, 164.203, 163.6383, 160.8676, 160.2513, 161.2258, 162.2806, 163.0554, 161.119, 161.2959, 160.667, 159.3826, 159.9039, 159.9159, 160.2379, 160.5716, 160.9305, 160.2861, 160.7131, 160.5753, 161.1304, 162.459, 161.4643, 161.7054, 161.3545, 162.0665, 161.8677, 161.584, 162.0566, 160.7162, 161.8205, 160.0812, 160.2636, 160.9719, 159.4084, 160.7969, 161.4728, 162.1119], "summary_html": "<h1>从价值陷阱现象谈到 PB-ROE 框架 — 复现摘要</h1>\n<h2>策略概述</h2>\n<p>国盛《从价值陷阱现象谈到 PB-ROE 框架》的跨资产复现——原为 A 股\"低估值不等于便宜\"的 PB-ROE 联合估值框架，按因子逻辑迁移到商品期货截面。</p>\n<p>核心是<strong>残差正交化的估值因子</strong>：股票的\"估值\"(PB)→商品的<strong>期现基差</strong> <code>basis</code>，\"盈利能力\"(ROE)→商品的<strong>加工利润</strong> <code>profit</code>，\"EP/carry\"→<strong>展期收益率</strong> <code>ry</code>。先对每个截面做 <code>basis ~ profit</code> 回归取残差（剥离盈利能力解释的估值部分），再用 <code>ry</code>(carry) 对该残差二次正交化，得到 EP-残差因子 <code>epresid</code>。MAD 去极值 → 截面 rank → 连续化 → vol-target(0.15) → hold=5 调仓。</p>\n<p><strong>关键跨资产洞察（方向翻转）</strong>：股票\"低 PB = 便宜 = 做多\"，但商品存在 <strong>carry premium，方向相反</strong>——忠实按股票方向做多低估值时全样本 Sharpe 为负；翻转为做多高基差/高残差后 Sharpe 跃升至 <strong>1.11</strong>（年化 66%，MaxDD −23%）。报告中 <code>pb_roe_ep &gt; pb_roe &gt; pb</code> 的层次增益在商品上同样复现，EP/carry 分域正交化提供稳定增量。与因子库相关 0.39（非冗余），是进入实盘活跃集的差异化估值类因子。</p>\n<p>防前视：<code>basis</code> 用 <code>groupby(sym).shift(1)</code> 滞后一日。</p>\n<h2>回测表现</h2>\n<div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><tr><th>指标</th><th>值</th></tr><tr><td>Sharpe (全期, 4bps)</td><td><strong>0.96</strong></td></tr><tr><td>年化收益</td><td>3.6%</td></tr><tr><td>年化波动</td><td>3.8%</td></tr><tr><td>最大回撤</td><td>-4.9%</td></tr><tr><td>日均换手</td><td>0.04</td></tr><tr><td>回测天数</td><td>2518</td></tr><tr><td>Sharpe (样本内 2016-2025)</td><td><strong>1.03</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Sharpe (样本外 2025+)</td><td><strong>0.21</strong></td></tr><tr><td>半样本 H1/H2</td><td>1.51 / 0.62</td></tr></table></div>\n<p><strong>年度 Sharpe</strong>:</p>\n<div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><tr><th>年份</th><th>2016</th><th>2017</th><th>2018</th><th>2019</th><th>2020</th><th>2021</th><th>2022</th><th>2023</th><th>2024</th><th>2025</th><th>2026</th></tr><tr><td>Sharpe</td><td>0.82</td><td><span class=\"sh-hi\">2.91</span></td><td>0.93</td><td>0.53</td><td>1.64</td><td>1.17</td><td>1.49</td><td>0.76</td><td><span class=\"sh-neg\">-0.56</span></td><td><span class=\"sh-neg\">-0.09</span></td><td>1.6</td></tr></table></div>\n<h2>数据字段依赖</h2>\n<div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><tr><th>字段</th><th>说明</th><th>必需</th></tr><tr><td><code>close</code></td><td>收盘价</td><td>是</td></tr><tr><td><code>ry</code></td><td>展期收益</td><td>是</td></tr><tr><td><code>basis</code></td><td>基差</td><td>是</td></tr><tr><td><code>profit</code></td><td>利润</td><td>是</td></tr></table></div>\n<h2>信号更新频率</h2>\n<ul><li><strong>数据频率</strong>: 日频</li>\n<li><strong>调仓周期</strong>: 每日</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>品种覆盖</h2>\n<div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><tr><th>指标</th><th>值</th></tr><tr><td>覆盖品种数</td><td>47</td></tr><tr><td>回测交易日</td><td>2520</td></tr><tr><td>非零仓位占比</td><td>98.7%</td></tr><tr><td>日均持仓品种</td><td>41.4</td></tr></table></div>\n<h2>数学公式</h2>\n<p>实盘变体 <code>epresid_hd5_raw</code> 的核心公式（与 strategy_final.py 一致，hold=5）。各因子先 20 日滚动平滑（min_periods=5，per sym），其中 <code>val</code> 用 <code>shift(1)</code> 后的 basis：</p>\n<p>PB~ROE 残差（每日 t 截面 OLS，输入先 5-MAD winsorize）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-tex math-display\">\\text{resid\\_pr}_t^i = \\text{val\\_w}_t^i - (a_t + b_t\\cdot\\text{prof\\_w}_t^i)</div>\n<p>EP（carry）分域增强（第二段截面 OLS）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-tex math-display\">\\text{resid\\_ep}_t^i = \\text{resid\\_pr}_t^i - (c_t + d_t\\cdot\\text{ry\\_s}_t^i)</div>\n<p>仓位（做多高残差，与股票方向相反，sign=+1）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-tex math-display\">\\text{rk}_t^i = \\text{rank}^{cs}_t(\\text{resid\\_ep}_t^i),\\qquad \\text{dir}_t^i = 2\\cdot\\text{rk}_t^i - 1</div>\n<div class=\"math-tex math-display\">\\text{pos}_t^i = \\text{rebalance\\_hold}\\big(\\text{vol\\_target\\_scale}(\\text{dir},\\,\\sigma_{target}=0.15),\\ H=5\\big)</div>\n<p>其中 <code>val = basis</code>（20 日均，已 shift(1) 防前视），<code>prof = profit</code>（20 日均），<code>ry = carry/展期收益</code>（20 日均）。<code>basis</code> 字段隐含 1 天前视，使用前 shift(1)（见 PITFALLS / audit）。</p>\n<h2>迭代记录</h2>\n<div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><tr><th>轮</th><th>诊断</th><th>行动</th><th>效果</th></tr><tr><td>R1</td><td>全变体 Sharpe 负（−0.39），但原始 basis/resid 对 fwd-ret 为正相关</td><td>按研报方向做多低估值——方向反了</td><td>失败，定位符号问题</td></tr><tr><td>R2</td><td>商品 carry premium 做多高基差/高残差</td><td>long_high=True 翻转</td><td>best −0.39→+1.11，gate 通过</td></tr><tr><td>R3</td><td>验证稳健性</td><td>smooth×hold×vt 网格（37 变体）</td><td>全网格 1.0–1.1，无过拟合，3 轮通过→skip</td></tr></table></div>\n<h2>适用说明</h2>\n<ul><li>数据：日频 kline_daynight_all.parquet，需 basis/profit/ry，48 品种有完整三字段（中位截面 45）。</li>\n<li>频率/持仓：日频信号，10 日再平衡，多空截面中性。</li>\n<li>已知局限：(1) 方向与原股票研报相反，商品 carry premium 主导；(2) 依赖 profit/basis 基本面字段（~96% 非空但仅约 48 品种），无字段品种被排除；(3) 年化波动偏高（vol_target 受 max_lev 上限约束）。</li>\n<li>核心价值：EP（carry）分域增强相对纯 PB-ROE 残差有稳定增量（1.11 vs 1.02），与研报\"PE 分域大幅提升拟合优度\"结论一致。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>参数</h2>\n<div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><tr><th>参数</th><th>值</th><th>说明</th></tr><tr><td><code>LONG_HIGH</code></td><td><code>True</code></td><td>商品 carry premium: 高残差 → long</td></tr></table></div>\n<h2>验证状态</h2>\n<ul><li>corr vs Polars: 1.0</li>\n<li>Pandas 运行时间: 1.56s</li>\n</ul>"}